📘 Basic Cloud Terminologies
Term	Description
Instance	A virtual machine or compute resource
Region	A geographical location where cloud data centers are located
Availability Zone	Isolated data center within a region
Virtual Network (VNet)	A logically isolated network in the cloud
Storage Account	A container for blobs/files/disks in cloud
Serverless	Code execution without managing servers (e.g., AWS Lambda, Azure Functions)
